### Generate content

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Improve writing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "improve",
  "input": "i am writing this email to ask about the project status",
  "tone": "professional",
  "length": "medium",
  "outputFormat": "paragraphs"
}

### Rewrite content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "rewrite",
  "input": "We need to finish this project quickly.",
  "tone": "friendly",
  "length": "short",
  "outputFormat": "auto"
}

### Summarize content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "summarize",
  "input": "Paste a longer article or text here.",
  "tone": "professional",
  "length": "short",
  "outputFormat": "bullets"
}

### Grammar correction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "grammar",
  "input": "She don't know where the documents is.",
  "tone": "formal",
  "length": "medium",
  "outputFormat": "auto"
}

### Expand content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "expand",
  "input": "Regular exercise improves health.",
  "tone": "friendly",
  "length": "long",
  "outputFormat": "paragraphs"
}

### Generate content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "generate",
  "input": "Write a short introduction for a personal portfolio website.",
  "tone": "professional",
  "length": "medium",
  "outputFormat": "paragraphs"
}

### Generate an email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "generate",
  "input": "Write an email requesting a meeting with a project supervisor.",
  "tone": "formal",
  "length": "medium",
  "outputFormat": "email",
  "customInstructions": "Keep the email polite and concise."
}

### Invalid operation (expected 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "invalid",
  "input": "Hello",
  "tone": "professional",
  "length": "medium"
}

### Empty input (expected 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "improve",
  "input": "",
  "tone": "professional",
  "length": "medium"
}

### Oversized request body (expected 413)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

< ./payloads/oversized.json